direction: right
input: Declared configured source
build: Same owned workspace after seed build
saved: Preserved completed seed
proof: Input ancestry + receipt + full identities + independent inodes
past: Earlier snapshot retained
reuse: Old descriptor reuse rejected
ready: Saved runtime available
refuse: Missing or changed proof rejected
input -> build: admitted mutation
build -> saved: existing freeze
build -> proof
saved -> proof
proof -> past: verified
past -> reuse: no current-byte authority
saved -> ready: current identity checked
proof -> refuse: unknown or mismatch
